{
 "id": "countable-uncountable",
 "title": "Dénombrable ou indénombrable ?",
 "level": "A2",
 "topic": "Grammaire",
 "summary": "some, any, much, many, a lot of, few, little : les quantités sans se tromper.",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "type": "h",
   "text": "Deux familles de noms"
  },
  {
   "type": "list",
   "items": [
    "**Dénombrables** : on peut les compter, ils ont un pluriel (*a laptop, two laptops*).",
    "**Indénombrables** : masse, matière, notion. Pas de pluriel ni de « a » (*water, information, advice, music, news, furniture, software, money*)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "tip",
   "text": "**Piège** : *information, advice, news, furniture, software, luggage* sont **indénombrables** en anglais (pas de -s). *a piece of advice*, *two pieces of information*."
  },
  {
   "type": "h",
   "text": "Quantités"
  },
  {
   "type": "table",
   "head": [
    "",
    "Dénombrable",
    "Indénombrable"
   ],
   "rows": [
    [
     "beaucoup (question/négation)",
     "how many / not many",
     "how much / not much"
    ],
    [
     "beaucoup (affirmatif)",
     "a lot of / lots of",
     "a lot of / lots of"
    ],
    [
     "un peu / quelques",
     "a few",
     "a little"
    ],
    [
     "peu (insuffisant)",
     "few",
     "little"
    ],
    [
     "some / any",
     "some (+), any (−/?)",
     "some (+), any (−/?)"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "*a few / a little* sont positifs (il y en a un peu). *few / little* sont négatifs (presque pas)."
  },
  {
   "type": "h",
   "text": "some ou any ?"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "*some* dans les phrases affirmatives, *any* dans les négations et les questions. Exception : *some* dans une offre : *Would you like some tea?*"
  },
  {
   "type": "ex",
   "en": "I have a lot of emails to read.",
   "fr": "J'ai beaucoup de mails à lire."
  },
  {
   "type": "ex",
   "en": "There isn't much time.",
   "fr": "Il n'y a pas beaucoup de temps."
  },
  {
   "type": "ex",
   "en": "Do you have any questions?",
   "fr": "Avez-vous des questions ?"
  },
  {
   "type": "ex",
   "en": "Can I have a little water?",
   "fr": "Puis-je avoir un peu d'eau ?"
  }
 ],
